<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AccShop Premium - Shop Acc Blox Fruit Uy Tín</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@700;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ===== BIẾN TOÀN CỤC ===== */
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
:root {
  --bg: #05050f;
  --bg-2: #0d0d1f;
  --card: rgba(25, 25, 45, 0.6);
  --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  --accent: #8b5cf6;
  --accent-2: #06b6d4;
  --accent-3: #ec4899;
  --text: #f8fafc;
  --muted: #94a3b8;
  --success: #10b981;
}

/* Nền động (Animated Background) */
body {
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  background-color: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  line-height: 1.6;
  overflow-x: hidden;
  position: relative;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

/* Hiệu ứng ánh sáng nền */
body::before {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%),
              radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) 0%, transparent 30%);
  z-index: -1;
  animation: rotateBg 20s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes rotateBg {
  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}

/* ===== HEADER (Glassmorphism) ===== */
.header {
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(5, 5, 15, 0.6);
  backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:16px 20px}
.logo{font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;letter-spacing:1px}
.logo .accent{color:var(--accent);text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent)}
.logo-icon{font-size: 28px; animation: pulseGlow 2s infinite alternate}
@keyframes pulseGlow {
  0% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px var(--accent)); }
  100% { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--accent-2)); }
}

.nav{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-left:auto}
.nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;transition:all .3s; position: relative;}
.nav a::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: -5px; left: 0; width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--accent-2); transition: width 0.3s; }
.nav a:hover{color:var(--text)}
.nav a:hover::after { width: 100%; }

.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
.search-box{position:relative}
.search-box input{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px 10px 38px;color:var(--text);width:200px;font-size:14px;transition:all .3s; outline: none;}
.search-box input:focus{border-color:var(--accent);width:240px; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);}
.search-icon{position:absolute;left:12px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);opacity:.6}

.cart-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #a855f7); color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); }
.cart-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6); }
.cart-count { background: #fff; color: var(--accent); border-radius: 50%; min-width: 22px; height: 22px; font-size: 13px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 800; }

/* ===== HERO ===== */
.hero{text-align:center;padding:100px 20px 60px;position:relative}
.hero-title{font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,64px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.1; text-transform: uppercase;}
.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2),var(--accent-3));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent; background-size: 200% auto; animation: shine 3s linear infinite;}
@keyframes shine { to { background-position: 200% center; } }

.hero-sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:20px;font-size:18px; max-width: 600px; margin-inline: auto;}
.hero-stats{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:60px;margin-top:50px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat{display:flex;flex-direction:column; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--border); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);}
.stat strong{font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:32px;color:var(--accent-2); text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);}
.stat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-top: 4px;}

/* ===== FILTER ===== */
.filters{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin:40px auto 30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filter-bar{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filter-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 22px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;transition:all .3s}
.filter-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--text); background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.1);}
.filter-btn.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a855f7);border-color:transparent;color:#fff; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4);}

.sort-select{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer; outline: none;}
.sort-select option { background: var(--bg-2); }

/* ===== PRODUCT GRID ===== */
.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:24px;padding-bottom:60px}
.product-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;transition:all .4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);display:flex;flex-direction:column; position: relative; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);}
.product-card:hover{transform:translateY(-10px);border-color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); z-index: 10;}

/* Hiệu ứng viền sáng khi hover */
.product-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2px; background: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask-composite: exclude; pointer-events: none; transition: all 0.4s; }
.product-card:hover::before { background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2)); }

.product-img{height:180px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:80px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(30,30,60,0.8),rgba(50,20,80,0.8));position:relative; overflow: hidden;}
.product-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.8; transition: transform 0.5s; }
.product-card:hover .product-img img { transform: scale(1.1); }

.badge{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-3),#f43f5e);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.4); z-index: 2; text-transform: uppercase;}
.badge.hot{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#ef4444)}
.badge.vip{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eab308,#ca8a04); box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.6);}

.product-body{padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.product-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);}
.product-desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;flex:1;margin-bottom:16px; line-height: 1.5;}
.product-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:16px}
.product-rating{color:#fbbf24;font-size:14px;font-weight: 600; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px;}
.product-price{font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:900; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);}

.btn-buy{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#a855f7);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;transition:all .3s;font-size:15px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;}
.btn-buy::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); transform: rotate(45deg); transition: all 0.5s; opacity: 0; }
.btn-buy:hover{transform:scale(1.03); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5);}
.btn-buy:hover::after { opacity: 1; left: 100%; }

.empty-state{text-align:center;padding:80px 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px}

/* ===== FEATURES & FAQ ===== */
.section-title{text-align:center;font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,38px);margin:80px 0 40px; text-transform: uppercase;}
.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:24px}
.feature-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;transition:all .3s; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);}
.feature-card:hover{border-color:var(--accent-2);transform:translateY(-6px); box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);}
.feature-icon{font-size:48px;margin-bottom:16px; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.2));}
.feature-card h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:12px; color: #fff;}
.feature-card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

.faq-list{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 80px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.faq-item{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:20px 24px;transition:all .3s; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);}
.faq-item[open]{border-color:var(--accent); box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15);}
.faq-item summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;list-style:none; font-size: 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.faq-item summary::after{content:'+';color:var(--accent); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; transition: transform 0.3s;}
.faq-item[open] summary::after{content:'-'; transform: rotate(180deg);}
.faq-item p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;font-size:15px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding-top: 16px;}

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:rgba(5,5,15,0.8);margin-top:60px; backdrop-filter: blur(10px);}
.footer-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;gap:40px;padding:60px 20px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto}
.footer-brand p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;font-size:14px}
.footer-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.footer-col h4{margin-bottom:8px;font-size:16px; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 1px;}
.footer-col a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;transition:color .2s; display: inline-block;}
.footer-col a:hover{color:var(--accent-2); transform: translateX(5px);}
.footer-bottom{text-align:center;padding:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}

/* ===== CART DRAWER ===== */
.cart-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.8);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .4s;z-index:200}
.cart-overlay.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
.cart-drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;width:400px;max-width:100vw;height:100vh;background:var(--bg-2);border-left:1px solid var(--border);z-index:201;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column; box-shadow: -20px 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);}
.cart-drawer.show{transform:translateX(0)}
.cart-header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.cart-header h3 { font-family: 'Orbitron', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; }
.close-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:none;color:var(--text);font-size:20px;cursor:pointer; width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; transition: all 0.2s;}
.close-btn:hover{background: #ef4444; transform: rotate(90deg);}
.cart-items{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.cart-item{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:16px; transition: all 0.3s;}
.cart-item:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
.cart-item-icon{font-size:36px}
.cart-item-info{flex:1}
.cart-item-info h4{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px; color: #fff;}
.cart-item-info span{color:var(--accent-2);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}
.cart-item-remove{background:none;border:none;color:#ef4444;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px; padding: 8px; transition: transform 0.2s;}
.cart-item-remove:hover { transform: scale(1.2); }
.cart-footer{padding:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);}
.cart-total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:18px; font-weight: 700;}
.cart-total strong{color:var(--accent-2);font-family:'Orbitron',sans-serif; font-size: 24px; text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);}
.btn-checkout{width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--success),#059669);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: all 0.3s;}
.btn-checkout:hover{opacity:.9; transform: scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);}
.cart-empty{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);padding:60px 20px; font-size: 16px;}

/* ===== TOAST (Thông báo) ===== */
.toast{position:fixed;bottom:30px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(150px);background:rgba(25, 25, 45, 0.95);border:1px solid var(--success);color:var(--text);padding:16px 32px;border-radius:16px;font-weight:600;z-index:300;opacity:0;transition:all .4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.6); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); font-size: 16px;}
.toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);opacity:1}

/* ===== MODAL ZALO ===== */
.modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); z-index: 400; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: all 0.3s; }
.modal-overlay.show { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
.modal-box { background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; text-align: center; max-width: 400px; width: 90%; box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); transform: scale(0.8); transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275); }
.modal-overlay.show .modal-box { transform: scale(1); }
.modal-icon { font-size: 60px; margin-bottom: 20px; animation: bounce 2s infinite; }
@keyframes bounce { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-15px); } }
.modal-box h3 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #fff; }
.modal-box p { color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 24px; }
.zalo-btn { display: inline-block; background: #0068FF; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 104, 255, 0.4); }
.zalo-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 104, 255, 0.6); }

@media(max-width:768px){
  .nav{display:none}
  .search-box input{width:140px}
  .search-box input:focus{width:160px}
  .footer-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px; text-align: center;}
  .footer-col { align-items: center; }
  .hero-stats{gap:20px}
  .stat { padding: 10px 20px; }
  .stat strong { font-size: 24px; }
  .filters{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
  .sort-select { width: 100%; }
  .product-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .product-img { height: 140px; font-size: 60px; }
  .product-body { padding: 12px; }
  .product-name { font-size: 15px; }
  .product-desc { font-size: 12px; }
  .product-price { font-size: 18px; }
  .btn-buy { padding: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="header">
  <div class="container header-inner">
    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">⚡</span><span>ACC<span class="accent">SHOP</span></span></a>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#products">Sản phẩm</a>
      <a href="#features">Cam kết</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <div class="search-box">
        <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Tìm acc...">
        <span class="search-icon">🔍</span>
      </div>
      <button class="cart-btn" id="cartBtn">🛒 <span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="hero-title">Shop Acc <span class="gradient">Blox Fruit & Game</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Giao acc tự động 24/7 • Bảo hành trọn đời • Hoàn tiền 100% nếu sai mô tả</p>
    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat"><strong>12.5K+</strong><span>Acc đã bán</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>4.9★</strong><span>Đánh giá</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Hỗ trợ Zalo</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container filters" id="products">
  <div class="filter-bar">
    <button class="filter-btn active" data-cat="all">Tất cả</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="bloxfruit">Blox Fruit</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="lienquan">Liên Quân</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="freefire">Free Fire</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="pubg">PUBG Mobile</button>
    <button class="filter-btn" data-cat="genshin">Genshin</button>
  </div>
  <select id="sortSelect" class="sort-select">
    <option value="default">Sắp xếp: Mặc định</option>
    <option value="price-asc">Giá tăng dần</option>
    <option value="price-desc">Giá giảm dần</option>
    <option value="rating">Đánh giá cao</option>
  </select>
</section>

<section class="container">
  <div class="product-grid" id="productGrid"></div>
  <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState" style="display:none"><p>😢 Không tìm thấy acc nào phù hợp</p></div>
</section>

<section class="features container" id="features">
  <h2 class="section-title">Tại sao chọn <span class="gradient">AccShop</span>?</h2>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">⚡</div><h3>Giao acc tự động</h3><p>Nhận acc ngay sau khi thanh toán, không cần chờ đợi.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div><h3>Bảo hành trọn đời</h3><p>Hỗ trợ đổi/hoàn nếu acc có vấn đề trong suốt thời gian sử dụng.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">💯</div><h3>Hoàn tiền 100%</h3><p>Acc sai mô tả? Hoàn tiền ngay lập tức, không cần lý do.</p></div>
    <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🎧</div><h3>Hỗ trợ 24/7</h3><p>Đội ngũ CSKH luôn online, phản hồi trong 5 phút qua Zalo.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="container faq" id="faq">
  <h2 class="section-title">Câu hỏi <span class="gradient">thường gặp</span></h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details class="faq-item"><summary>Mua acc có an toàn không?</summary><p>100% an toàn. Mọi acc đều được kiểm duyệt kỹ trước khi đăng bán, cam kết không bị thu hồi.</p></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary>Tôi nhận acc bằng cách nào?</summary><p>Sau khi thanh toán (chuyển khoản), bạn nhắn Zalo <b>0325518652</b> để nhận thông tin đăng nhập acc ngay lập tức.</p></details>
    <details class="faq-item"><summary>Có được đổ
